[1.6,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.13                  ≈ 11 in 100 breaking flags wrong, not 8\r\n"]
[1.66,"o","  3  Anthropic                 ≈ $0.15                  ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[1.72,"o","  4  Not now                   free                     ≈ 27%: advisories and deprecations only\r\n"]
